#. TRANSLATORS: "Flesch Reading Ease" should not be translated.
#: projects/base_project.cpp:823
msgid ""
"Amstad is a recalculation of Flesch Reading Ease for German text. It is "
"meant for secondary and adult-level text. Scores range from 0-100 (the "
"higher the score, the easier to read). Average documents should be within "
"the range of 60-70."
msgstr ""
"Amstad es un recálculo de Flesch Reading Ease para texto alemán. Está "
"pensado para texto secundario y de nivel adulto. Las puntuaciones van de 0 a "
"100 (cuanto mayor sea la puntuación, más fácil de leer). El promedio de "
"documentos debe estar dentro del rango de 60-70."

#: projects/base_project.cpp:859
msgid ""
"The <a href=\"#schwartz\">Schwartz German Readability Graph</a> is designed "
